  "title": "Quietly Smoked German Sausage Skillet",
  "description": "A fermented and silky German dish featuring sriracha and smoked sausage, prepared in a cold smoke process and aligned with ayurvedic tamasic principles. This meal prep recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
