  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large skillet over medium heat and add the sliced onions.",
    "Cook the onions until they are translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the diced potatoes, sliced carrots, and smoked German sausage to the skillet.",
    "Cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the potatoes and carrots are tender.",
    "Stir in the sauerkraut, sriracha sauce, and apple cider vinegar.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the flavors are combined.",
    "Season with black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
